% ============================================================
% capstyle.sty
% Style for "From Independent Scientist to Novel Performer: A Small-Business
% Operating, Milestone, and Capitalization Plan for a Phase 1 LLM-Advised
% Robotic Whipple (ChemicalQDevice)".  Draft 1.0, repository v4.5.0,
% San Diego, August 11, 2026.
%
% WHAT THIS STYLE IS.  It adapts applystyle.sty from
% funding/pdac-funding-applications/final-apply and keeps that work's five TikZ
% diagram vocabularies, one per machine-readable diagram platform:
%
%   1) mermaid-type            (mm* styles)   flowchart / sequence / state / gantt
%   2) plantuml-type           (uml* styles)  use case / state with guards / activity
%   3) d2-type                 (d2* styles)   containers, grids, sql tables, layers
%   4) diagrams (python)-type  (dg* styles)   clustered infrastructure with glyphs
%   5) graphviz-type           (gv* styles)   dot records, clusters, fault trees
%
% WHAT IS NEW HERE.  Three things, and nothing else:
%
%   a) The FIGURE SPACING INVARIANT is -0.65cm, not -0.7cm.  appfig closes with
%      a RIGID \vskip 24.5pt and \figcaption opens with \nointerlineskip, so the
%      distance from the frame rule to the first caption line is exactly
%      24.5pt - 0.65cm = 6.06pt for every figure and every table in this paper,
%      floating or inline, whatever precedes or follows it on the page.
%
%   b) A NEW COVER.  \capmast, \capledger and \capcell replace the parent's
%      \paymast / \paystrip / \paycell.  The parent used a left-accent masthead
%      over a ten-cell recipient strip; this paper uses a ruled panel with a top
%      accent band over a three-cell money ledger, because the subject is one
%      recipient and three numbers rather than ten recipients and one.  Both
%      vary deliberately from the RFA-RM-27-001-v2 centred form-field theme.
%
%   c) \DiagramXShift and the adjustwidth carrier, taken from the author's own
%      correction 11 in final-apply/publication/useredits.md, so a figure that
%      sits optically left of the measure can be nudged without changing the
%      figure or the caption spacing.
%
% PALETTE BUDGET.  Corporate Blue #00417A, Professional Gray #6C757D, Classic
% White, three grayscale fills (#E9ECEF, #CED4DA, #9AA1A8) and two lighter
% shades of #00417A (#3C7DB2, #DCE8F1).  The master prompt forbids black filled
% boxes, so black survives only as a stroke colour and as text.  The parent
% style's near-black fill token is deleted; a palette audit is a search for
% that token's name, spelled p-a-d-a-r-k, which must return nothing outside
% this sentence and does.
%
% SENIOR-AUTHOR FORMATTING.  RaggedRight body with even interword spacing and
% no right-margin overflow; maximal widow, orphan and broken penalties so no
% single line is stranded and no paragraph ends in a one-word or two-word line;
% long URLs break on any character; single hyphens only, no em dash and no
% double dash; the section symbol for every codified reference.  No raster
% images anywhere.
% ============================================================
\NeedsTeXFormat{LaTeX2e}
\ProvidesPackage{capstyle}[2026/08/11 v4.5.0 ChemicalQDevice capitalization plan style]

